sible for websites (or their content) that are not owned by the publisher.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#30"}, {"id": "en-copyright-31", "kind": "text", "text": "ISBN: 978-1-9753-5987-4", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#31"}, {"id": "en-copyright-32", "kind": "text", "text": "E3-20190607-JV-NF-ORI", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#32"}, {"id": "en-toc-0", "kind": "heading", "text": "Contents", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#0", "headingLevel": 2}, {"id": "en-toc-1", "kind": "text", "text": "Cover", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#1"}, {"id": "en-toc-2", "kind": "text", "text": "Insert", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#2"}, {"id": "en-toc-3", "kind": "text", "text": "Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#3"}, {"id": "en-toc-4", "kind": "text", "text": "Copyright", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#4"}, {"id": "en-toc-5", "kind": "text", "text": "Cast of Characters", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#5"}, {"id": "en-toc-6", "kind": "text", "text": "SS 1: Short Story 1: Hachiman Hikigaya’s idea of “Mom’s cooking” is wrong, as I expected.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#6", "emphasis": [{"start": 21, "end": 38, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-7", "kind": "text", "text": "SA A: Special Act: Side-A: We must wish them all the best in their futures.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#7", "emphasis": [{"start": 40, "end": 48, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-8", "kind": "text", "text": "SS 2: Short Story 2: Of course, Hachiman Hikigaya’s kindness is contrary.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#8", "emphasis": [{"start": 32, "end": 49, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-9", "kind": "text", "text": "BT: Bonus track!: Komachi Hikigaya’s Plot.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#9", "emphasis": [{"start": 18, "end": 34, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-10", "kind": "text", "text": "SS 3: Short Story 3: Unexpectedly, Hachiman Hikigaya’s studying methods are not wrong.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#10", "emphasis": [{"start": 35, "end": 52, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-11", "kind": "text", "text": "SA B: Special Act: Side-B: They have yet to know of a place they should go back to.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#11", "emphasis": [{"start": 27, "end": 31, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-12", "kind": "text", "text": "SS 4: Short Story 4: Regardless, Hachiman Hikigaya’s positive thinking is completely twisted.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#12", "emphasis": [{"start": 33, "end": 50, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-13", "kind": "text", "text": "Afterword", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#13"}, {"id": "en-toc-14", "kind": "text", "text": "Translation Notes", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#14"}, {"id": "en-toc-15", "kind": "text", "text": "Yen Newsletter", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#15"}, {"id": "en-charater-0", "kind": "image", "text": "Book Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/charater.xhtml#../Images/Art_P3.jpg", "src": "assets/english/volume-7-5/Art_P3.webp", "width": 1200, "height": 1800}]}
